@startuml SEQ_05_MENGELOLA_PEMINJAMAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-05: Mengelola Peminjaman Aset

actor       "Admin / Asisten"      as User
boundary    "Browser"              as Browser
control     "InventarisController" as Controller
entity      "PeminjamanAset Model" as ModelPM
entity      "Aset Model"           as ModelAset
database    "peminjaman_aset"      as DB

== Lihat Peminjaman ==

User    -> Browser     : Buka menu peminjaman
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/peminjaman
Controller -> ModelPM  : Query data peminjaman
ModelPM -> DB          : SELECT peminjaman_aset
DB      --> ModelPM    : Data peminjaman
ModelPM --> Controller : Data peminjaman
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman
Browser --> User       : Tampil daftar peminjaman

== Catat Peminjaman ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik "Catat", isi form
Browser -> Controller  : POST /inventaris/peminjaman\n{aset_id, data_peminjam}
Controller -> ModelAset  : Query aset
ModelAset -> DB          : SELECT aset WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> ModelAset    : Data aset
Controller -> ModelAset  : update status dipinjam
ModelAset -> DB          : UPDATE aset SET status = 'dipinjam'
DB      --> ModelAset    : Berhasil
Controller -> ModelPM  : Simpan peminjaman
ModelPM -> DB          : INSERT peminjaman_aset
DB      --> ModelPM    : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect + notifikasi
Browser --> User       : Peminjaman tersimpan

== Kembalikan Aset ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik "Kembalikan"
Browser -> Controller  : POST /inventaris/peminjaman/{id}/kembalikan\n{data_pengembalian}
Controller -> ModelPM  : Update data pengembalian
ModelPM -> DB          : UPDATE peminjaman_aset
DB      --> ModelPM    : Berhasil
Controller -> ModelAset  : update status tersedia
ModelAset -> DB          : UPDATE aset SET status = 'tersedia'
DB      --> ModelAset    : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect + notifikasi
Browser --> User       : Aset kembali tersedia

@enduml
